    "rich_text_Vtj4Dt": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_d3KwBy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "a deep dive into shamballa jewels",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zqVN8X": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Designs that Inspire</strong> <br/>Our collection of pendants features a wealth of unique and eye-catching designs that cater to every taste. From simple, minimalist shapes to more detailed and artistic creations, our pendants are designed to catch the eye and spark conversation. Whichever style you choose, your pendant is sure to become a highlight in your jewelry collection.</p><p><strong>Unmatched Materials</strong><br/>We believe that quality is the key to timeless jewelry. That’s why we only use the finest materials, including 18-karat gold, rose gold, white gold, and black rhodinated gold. These materials not only provide a luxurious finish but also ensure that your pendant retains its beauty through the years.</p><p><strong>Diamonds</strong><br/>Each pendant from Shamballa Jewels can be adorned with exquisite diamonds that<br/>add an extra level of glamour. Our selection includes both white and black diamonds, creating a captivating contrast and giving a personal touch to each piece. It is these details that make our pendants unique works of art.</p><p><strong>Perfect for All Occasions</strong><br/>Our pendants cater to both men and women seeking to express their style in a sophisticated way. Whether you want to add a touch of sparkle to your everyday look or create a statement for a special occasion, our pendants will be the perfect choice. They can be worn alone or paired with other jewelry to create a personal and stylish expression.</p><p><strong>Explore Shamballa Jewels</strong> <br/>We invite you to dive into our collection of pendants in our store in Copenhagen or online. Our dedicated team is ready to help you find the ideal pendant that matches your unique style. Discover the unparalleled beauty and quality of Shamballa Jewels’ pendants and add an extra touch of luxury to your jewelry collection.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
